    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "[Your Name]\n[Your Apartment Number]\n[City, State, Zip Code]\n[Email Address]\n[Phone Number]\n[Date]\n\n[Landlord's Name]\n[Landlord's Street Address]\n[City, State, Zip Code]\n\nDear [Landlord’s Name],\n\nI hope this letter finds you well. I write you regarding my apartment located at [Your Apartment Number], where the heating system has failed, thus severely impeding the ability to maintain a comfortable living temperature. As per my rights as a tenant under German residential law, I require my apartment to be habitable and this includes adequate heating during the colder months. As such, I am obligated to notify you about this malfunction.\n\nIndeed, I took the initiative to bleed the radiator in an effort to rectify the issue, however, this measure only provided minimal improvement without actually resolving the underlying malfunction. Despite these attempted remedies, I have thereby formally requested urgent rectification from your esteemed Hausverwaltung.\n\nGiven the integral service the heating element provides, potential negligence in facilitating prompt repair could result in my having to enforce a Mietminderung, or reduction in terms of rent, which should ideally be mutually avoided.\n\nIn light of the above, I kindly appeal for the immediate inclusion of a competent technician",
